  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Realisation of the UNGPs in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to contribute to a business environment in Pakistan which enables the protection and fulfilment of the rights of the most vulnerable. The project will achieve this through ensuring labour standards and the rights of informal workers are better upheld in the textiles sector through the implementation of the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights (UNGP), and that the right to work of marginalised communities, including women home-based workers, religious minorities and transgender persons, is advanced.</narrative>
  </description>
